am:"< 25MB",metricRamSub:"Low Homelab RAM",metricAppStore:"0s",metricAppStoreSub:"App Store Wait",interactiveDemoBadge:"Live Interactive Demo",demoStoreName:"Artisan Coffee Roasters",demoCardTitle:"Coffee Club Card",demoCardSubtitle:"Buy 9 coffees, get the 10th free!",demoProgressLabel:"Loyalty Progress",demoRewardReady:"Free Reward Unlocked!",demoRewardDesc:"Show this card to the cashier to claim your free artisan beverage.",demoRemainingStamps:"more stamps until your next free reward!",demoSimulateBtn:"Simulate +1 Stamp",featuresPreTitle:"Built for Modern Retail & Homelabs",featuresTitle:"Everything you need to run a loyalty program without friction.",featuresSubtitle:"No closed SaaS traps, no customer tracking surveillance, and zero recurring subscription fees.",feat1Title:"Frictionless PWA Experience",feat1Desc:"Customers scan a counter stand QR code with their native phone camera. The card opens in Safari or Chrome and can be installed to their home screen with 1 tap.",feat2Title:"Cryptographic Replay Protection",feat2Desc:"Tokens expire every 5 minutes and track unique JTIs in atomic database transactions. Screenshot sharing and replayed scans are immediately rejected.",feat3Title:"Ultra-Lean Go 1.26 Backend",feat3Desc:"Compiled to a static native binary running on 15–25MB RAM. Perfect for homelab k3s nodes, low-power Intel Celerons, or Raspberry Pis.",feat4Title:"Camera Scanner with Audio Haptics",feat4Desc:"Built-in web camera scanner for cashiers and baristas. Provides immediate audio beeps and vibration haptic feedback upon successful stamps or redemptions.",feat5Title:"RabbitMQ Event-Driven Core",feat5Desc:"Asynchronous event publishing for stamp transactions. Decouples live scanning from background audit logging, webhooks, and push notification workers.",feat6Title:"PostgreSQL & SQLite Dual Driver",feat6Desc:"Switch between zero-config local single-file SQLite testing and production PostgreSQL 16 cluster replication with a single environment variable.",v